# No em dashes

Do **not** use the Unicode em dash character `—` (U+2014) anywhere in this repo's product UI, emails, docs we ship, or source comments.

Use instead:

- A hyphen with spaces: ` - ` (mid-sentence separator)
- A period or comma to break the sentence
- Remove trailing decorative dashes after links/labels

Wrong: `End agreement (mutual surrender) — rarely needed`  
Right: `End agreement (mutual surrender)`

Wrong: `Connected & verified — paid out within 2 business days.`  
Right: `Connected and verified. Paid out within 2 business days.`
